    {
      "id": "8288c23b-e684-48a6-aed7-a4ef0672d441",
      "title": "Escute a frase e note que agora a memória fala de mais de uma aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "2e73a9f1-6772-4327-9e13-0cb6845fa927",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a lembrança passa para várias aulas.</p><p><strong>Las clases eran largas.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>As aulas eram longas.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7367260dfc984fa287bc3f22edd42390_b02-las-clases-eran-largas.mp3?Expires=1794099532&Signature=Da1mwVhbreP5DY2ZTstwJ7Lt~NCrb-eP8SJbpk60lOWfH407lbbVHsUbzMWS0wpbQw7mmGGqhhVt~c9ftcQYb6ntTIjM~96tBbktB~wVsrFjMG9T9Q6K9i8AhWjyqbDejGvDB3R-ZVgBXdVTqk36dop-4-Ume6Y9prc8TUXrTijHRpT9MALHjuY-ifDFKI~8B2Li-HmpCfei3jnljEbene8atEq-bfWtjlCbZ-xQrgM~kRC9GAviKamCpcgTdp38LRGvw0eccYjZc9Zsgx~gC9UnZwi4CFXSztxhzjPnfItFznC7oaxXyGU97VaGTpf8TINRqI~A5xTk7j0jZeUG1Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
