    {
      "id": "6b338e2a-a962-46f6-9078-3489a67ef936",
      "title": "Escute a frase e note que veía também fica em reconhecimento leve nesta aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "8117ef52-df3f-4c3b-b586-02c0c1b1eb26",
          "textContent": "<p>Mais uma memória curta, sem ampliar o escopo irregular.</p><p><strong>Veía a mis profesores todos los días.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Eu via meus professores todos os dias.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/31182fbe54cb4e25b55b5564485f7774_b05-veia-a-mis-profesores-todos-los-dias.mp3?Expires=1794099532&Signature=Vxxp7GZhgxtdQU9sLwHoORM~qUf5ldqbKGn4TkrySUgsKPcvpvaZ~tsA4HUjd-hqXmsoi35U09GwcII-LwctCT0AKagy4-kbWHPBR4H~K8~l~oPiSm40nOsbN4LRCMlzj2gAopCsKnB8Zug9Gqn7V80l~yCzBsgzNiNLVled8gS1ZTFa0ZlWQ-IaxU34okB3M70fNqYKQAF2B5X83wVfAb0NJEgbTq4hzZtHqkGkipbDH3OdNh6wSEL7pju3p4UUHZ6c898L1iOJDYilfrieVYBehrKdWrIclfu-KPnAMaKKVsrYWs94H6~JFSG6ztpndKm8x36yQCdDbGHYyPA76g__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
